    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "It's the beat (DOOM), he hear it in his sleep sometimes",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Blare it in your jeep so your peoples can stare at them rhymes",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Real rhymes not your everyday hologram",
          "rhyme": "am",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Even when ribs was touchin', never swallowed the ham",
          "rhyme": "am",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "He'd rather eat a sand sandwich salad",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "It might need salt like your man's bland ballad",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "A lot of stuff happens that the news won't tell yous",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Blues on L juice, snooze, all hell loose",
          "rhyme": "uz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Rake it, take it like the Good, the Bad, the Ugly",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Break it, rollin' through your hood in the caddy buggy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Butter softy, leather flossy, fatty juggy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Always threw me off when she told me, \"Daddy, funk me\"",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "I'm like, \"Anywhos\"",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Seeds walkin' all out in the street without any shoes",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "I guess it's better than some funky socks",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "You need to get her some skips before she catch the monkeypox (Hahahahaha)",
          "rhyme": "Oks",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Instead she wanna hear the beatbox",
          "rhyme": "Oks",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Take pills and make fake krills as sheetrock",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Sing it, bring it back to your laboratory",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "While he's in his oratory, glory, it's like a horror story",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "The mask is like Jason",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "They told the place not to let the basket type case in",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "He could be some kind of wacko",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Waitin' for the chance to heat the pipes like a crack ho",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "He busted in, blessed be the Lord",
          "rhyme": "ORd",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Who believe any mess they read up on a message board",
          "rhyme": "ORd",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "If so, I got bridges for the low-low",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Same bitch a-go dry snitchin' to the popo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Here, orange peel stogs for the whole tier",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Feel like I've been gone over a year, came home to old gear",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "It was the shit when I first scooped it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "At least I get to sit out in New York and curse stupid",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Plead the fifth, sip wine stiffly",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Patiently come up and be spiffy in a jiffy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Gift for the grind, criminal mind shifty",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Swift with the 9 through a 59FIFTY",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Well edumacated, he heard it when he meditated in deep theta",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Let her hate, the creep played her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Dedicated cheapskater who keeps data",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Say he stay self-medicated to sleep later",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "Side effects is similar to sugar pill",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "Whoever go next on the mic he put a booger, ew",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "And made his exit on some calm shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "Begged him on the regular for kegs of more vomitspit",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "(\"DOOM!\")",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
